# AgriGuard AI Environment Variables Configuration
# AgriGuard AI operates seamlessly in DEMO MODE out-of-the-box without requiring API keys.
# To enable live production API feeds, supply keys below:

# OpenWeatherMap API Key for hyperlocal weather telemetry & forecasts
VITE_WEATHER_API_KEY=your_openweather_api_key_here

# OpenAI API Key for GPT-4 Vision & agronomy chat assistant
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Google Gemini API Key for Gemini 1.5 Pro / Flash vision crop analysis
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
